menu "Emmaforo"

    config EMMAFORO_BATTERY_LOG
        bool "Keep a battery log in RAM for test devices"
        default y
        help
            Records a battery sample at a fixed period in a RAM ring buffer that
            survives soft resets (not power loss). A test build of the companion
            app reads it over Bluetooth and exports it as CSV/JSON. Recording
            only happens during the normal loop, so it costs no extra wake-ups.

    config EMMAFORO_BATTERY_LOG_PERIOD_S
        int "Seconds between battery log samples"
        depends on EMMAFORO_BATTERY_LOG
        range 10 3600
        default 120

    config EMMAFORO_BATTERY_LOG_CAPACITY
        int "Battery log samples kept (16 bytes each)"
        depends on EMMAFORO_BATTERY_LOG
        range 256 4096
        default 3072
        help
            3072 samples at 120 s cover a little over four days.

endmenu
